WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.160
Version the context
before requesting a draft.

00:00:02.304 --> 00:00:06.960
Bind the requirement, API contract,
fixture and test examples to named

00:00:07.032 --> 00:00:11.600
revisions. The proposed matrix
covers unchanged retries,

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:16.000
conflicting payloads, concurrent
requests and duplicate callbacks.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:19.440
An unresolved retention window
remains an open question.

00:00:19.707 --> 00:00:23.680
AI may draft candidate cases
with references, but domain reviewers

00:00:23.749 --> 00:00:27.520
define the ledger expectations.
A missing business rule should block

00:00:27.582 --> 00:00:31.200
approval of the affected case instead
of being filled in by the model.
